## 故障排除

### OpenCV未找到
```bash
# 查找conda环境
conda env list
# 设置环境变量
export OPENCV_ROOT=$(conda info --base)/envs/your_env
```

### 权限问题
```bash
chmod +x scripts/run_tests.sh
```